    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "b999a1bb-a624-4f9b-9576-c96ddac31514",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* central Lisbon hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional local guide\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Lisbon\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Portugal\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAudio headphones\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "860ea92f-dd46-4ed7-aac1-1cd9342f1b6d",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights on bed and breakfast basis at the 4* Fenix Urban Hotel in Lisbon. Centrally located close to Marqu\u00EAs de Pombal, facilities include a restaurant and bar and all rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "bceb49d6-47d2-4f8d-be3b-5c10e403b9fc",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Lisbon\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMosteiro dos Jer\u00F3nimos\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPal\u00E1cio dos Marqueses de Fronteira\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseu Nacional de Arte Antiga\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPal\u00E1cio Nacional de Queluz\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECascais\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESintra \u0026amp; Pal\u00E1cio Nacional da Pena\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESesimbra\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPalmela\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EParque Natural da Arr\u00E1bida\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseu Gulbenkian - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "ead6b76a-46df-41f8-a22d-5aab5e15976a",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u00C9vora - an enchanting walled city that rose to prominence under the Romans and flourished as a centre for learning and the arts, a guided tour takes in sights such as the Roman Temple, Convento dos L\u00F3ios and the Pra\u00E7a do Giraldo\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMuseu Nacional do Azulejo - located in the convent cloisters of Convento da Madre de Deus and dating back to 1509, the museum has decorative panels, individual tiles and photographs tracing the evolution of tile making from its introduction by the Moors\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPal\u00E1cio Nacional de Sintra - the main part of the palace, including the central block with its plain Gothic fa\u00E7ade, was built by Jo\u00E3o I in the late 14th century\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "376d3dce-e192-4d1a-8cab-03393aff2c64",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Lisbon\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Lisbon from your preferred airport \u2013 transfer with our professional guide in our private executive coach to the central 4* Fenix Urban Hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Lisbon guided tour, Mosteiro dos Jer\u00F3nimos, Pal\u00E1cio dos Marqueses de Fronteira \u0026amp; Museu Nacional de Arte Antiga\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EFull day in Lisbon \u2013 guided tour of Lisbon taking in sights such as the Belem Tower, Pedro Square, the Medieval Quarter of Alfama and the beautiful 16th century Hieronymite Cathedral \u2013 the beautiful 16th century Mosteiro dos Jer\u00F3nimos, the most impressive symbol of Portugal\u2019s power and wealth during the Age of Discovery, was constructed in 1502 to commemorate Vasco da Gama\u2019s voyage to India \u2013 built in 1640, Pal\u00E1cio dos Marqueses de Fronteira is one of the most beautiful residences in Lisbon, and its Room of the Battles is adorned with glazed tiles representing scenes of the Portuguese Restoration War while the stunning gardens boast some of the country\u0026#39;s finest tiles depicting hunting, battles and religious scenes \u2013 the Museu Nacional de Arte Antiga houses works by artists such as Hans Memling, Raphael and Tintoretto and its chapel is a fine example of 18th century Portuguese Baroque art and architecture.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Pal\u00E1cio Nacional de Queluz, Cascais, Sintra \u0026amp; Pal\u00E1cio Nacional da Pena\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EPal\u00E1cio Nacional de Queluz was commissioned in 1747 when the architect Mateus Vicente de Oliveira transformed Prince Dom Pedro\u2019s occasional hunting lodge into a summer palace now known as the \u2018Portuguese Versailles\u2019 \u2013 travelling along the picturesque Atlantic coastline and passing the cosmopolitan village of Estoril, we stop at the fishing village of Cascais \u2013 head inland to the idyllic mountain town of Sintra, adored by artists and writers from all over the world, where we have time at leisure for lunch \u2013 visit the UNESCO listed Pal\u00E1cio Nacional da Pena at Sintra, one of the best examples of 19th century romanticism in the world.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Sesimbra, Palmela \u0026amp; Parque Natural da Arr\u00E1bida\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003ESesimbra is a picturesque fishing village once occupied by the Romans and later the Moors until King Sancho II conquered its heavily defended forts in 1236 and where the Moorish castle offers wonderful panoramic views from the ramparts \u2013 explore the sights of the small hill town of Palmela including the Church of S\u00E3o Pedro with its 18th century tiles depicting scenes from the life of St Peter \u2013 return to Lisbon via the scenic Parque Natural da Arr\u00E1bida, established to protect the wild, beautiful landscape.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Museu Gulbenkian\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of the Museu Gulbenkian, one of Europe\u0026#39;s unsung treasures with a magnificent collection of Egyptian, Greek, Roman, Islamic, Asian and European art including masterpieces by Frans Hals, Rubens, Rembrandt, Fragonard and Gainsborough \u2013 transfer to Lisbon airport for our scheduled flight home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
